# Credential-bearing files that must never land in the repo (audit L-19).
# Note: apps/nextjs/.eluvix-config.json stays tracked DELIBERATELY — the
# desktop app reads a shipped default from it. Keep it free of real
# secrets: use .env / the admin password flow for credentials instead.
